// leetcode 881

// How could you have recognised sorting yourself?
Whenever you encounter a problem involving:
- Pairing elements.
- Finding two elements satisfying a condition.
- Minimising or maximising the number of pairs/groups.
- Comparing the smallest and largest values.
- A weight, sum, or capacity constraint.
Ask yourself:
"Would sorting help me make a decision about the smallest and largest elements?"


class Solution {
public:
    int numRescueBoats(vector<int>& people, int limit) {
        sort(people.begin(),people.end());
        int i=0;
        int n=people.size();
        int j=n-1;
        int ans=0;
        while(i<=j){
            if(people[i]+people[j]<=limit){
                i++;
            }
            ans++;
            j--;
        }
        return ans;
    }
};
